            Bulk orders with unbeatable prices <br>
            for retailers and resellers
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Competitive wholesale pricing</li>
            <li>Flexible Payments terms</li>
            <li>Priority Customer Support</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="contact">
            <p>CONTACT US</p>
            <span>Contact Number : +91 82389 45773</span><br>
            <span>kariyadiyesh@gmail.com</span>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT SIDE -->
